    <statement><p>Find the partial derivative indicated.
Assume the variables are restricted to a domain on
which the function is defined.
<me>z = \frac{3x^{2}y^{3}-y^{3}}{10xy-6}.</me> 
<m>z_y =</m> <fillin characters="65" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{\left(3x^{2}\cdot 3y^{2}-3y^{2}\right)\mathopen{}\left(10xy-6\right)-\left(3x^{2}y^{3}-y^{3}\right)\cdot 10x}{\left(10xy-6\right)^{2}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><me>z_y = \frac{\left(3x^{2}\cdot 3y^{2}-3y^{2}\right)\mathopen{}\left(10xy-6\right)-\left(3x^{2}y^{3}-y^{3}\right)\cdot 10x}{\left(10xy-6\right)^{2}}.</me>



</solution>
